# /public/build is deliberately NOT ignored: the panel's Filament theme has to
# be compiled, but the installer is Composer-only and production servers have
# no Node toolchain -- they deploy with a plain `git pull`. So the build output
# is committed. Run `npm run build` and commit the result after touching any
# asset or custom view.
